<openrocket version="1.11" creator="OpenRocket 26.xx-SNAPSHOT-5f164fd0e">
  <rocket>
    <name>Deployable Payload Example</name>
    <id>13fcc99a-97af-4285-a18b-3748b018fbdf</id>
    <axialoffset method="absolute">0.0</axialoffset>
    <position type="absolute">0.0</position>
    <comment>A modification of the Simple Model Rocket example to include a payload section that separates from the booster when the ejection charge fires and descends on a separate parachute.

Note that it&#39;s a bit overstable with the payload (the fins are modified to reduce this somewhat); also, the A8-3 motor doesn&#39;t give adequate speed off the rod.</comment>
    <designer>Sampo Niskanen
Joe Pfeiffer</designer>
    <designtype>original</designtype>
